Re-lands the D20 CLI broker factory on origin/master. buildKernelIssueDeps
injects the builtin SQLite driver so the CLI kernel path stops hitting
requireGuardedDriverMethods(undefined); buildMigratedKernelIssueDeps also
builds the broker and runs initialize() (pragmas + idempotent migrations).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
